      "spam": false,
      "value": "Actually, yea, I like this idea.  There are times I just want to block someone for a particular avatar, and if they chance that avatar, then they no longer are blocked.  Perhaps it gets tied to the avatar ID (although that ID will still remain hidden)\nI don't want to fully block people just for an avatar, but just block that avatar... though I can imagine there are those with multiple avatars who will swap out when they realize everyone' blocked their avatar.... but at least this would be a good step forward.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
