      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Yes, this needs to get in. With the Block Avatars by Default system already in, it's a perfect solution to people's horribly optimized avatars. People don't texture atlas, they throw dynamic bones on EVERYTHING. So one user can pretty much take 10-20 frames away from you single handed. \nBut I don't want to block them because they may have gotten it from a World and don't know any better, or they're just short-cutting the process and are a nice person regardless.\n\nThis would help performance as you can pretty much block avatars with the 40 dynamic bones in their hair avatars while still being able to talk to them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
