      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having a block/unblock button would be great, although my usage would be way different. Usually when it comes to largely filled servers I tend to use the 'block avatars by default' then I go and find my friends. But then the group tends to become bigger, so I usually have to add them to my friends list to see their avatar or decide to unblock all avatars and go through hellish frame rates. Having an 'unblock avatar' button on a player by player basis would be great in this case!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
