      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. Very important because in some worlds I dont want to block all avatars, especially those of the people I am talking to.  \n  \nSomething to add: the default \"block\" avatars should adapt to the size of the blocked avatars. So when I am speaking to a Loli I actually know it's a Loli and not a normal sized avatar.",
